```js
function faktorial(n) {
  if (n <= 1) return 1; // kes asas — wajib, elak tindanan limpah
  return n * faktorial(n - 1);
}
console.log(faktorial(5)); // 120
```
Every call needs a shrinking base case. Deep recursion overflows the stack — rewrite as a loop or trampoline for 10k+ depths.

